# Photo source data — kept locally, not versioned.
#
# Photos-1-001.zip is 100 MB, which is GitHub's hard per-file limit, and
# Public/extracted/ is the same 18 images unpacked — another 100 MB of exact
# duplicates. The model was built from them and every measurement they gave up
# is recorded in model/params.json with a `src` note, so the repo does not need
# the pixels to be reproducible.
Public/Photos-1-001.zip
Public/extracted/

# Working copies of the same photos.
refs/photos/

